  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study research cooperation Somalia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie forsksamarbete Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en upphandling av en studie om m&#xf6;jligheten f&#xf6;r Sida och Sverige att initiera forskningssamarbete med Somalia. Studien kommer att beskriva hur kapaciteten att bedriva forskning vid universiteten ser ut samt ge rekommendationer hur Sida/Sverige skulle kunna samarbete f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja forskningskapacitet i Somalia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a procurement of a feasibility study of research cooperation in Somalia. The study will provide a description of existing research capacity in Somalia and recommendations on if and how Sida could support research capacity building and research of high quality in Somalia.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention was to procure a feasibility study of Research Cooperation in Somalia. The study was finalised in February 2020. The titel of the study is &quot;Research in Somalia: opportunities for cooperation&quot;.&#xa0;
The responsible consultancy firm was ODI&#xa0;and the&#xa0;authors are: Arnaldo Pellini, Deqa I. Abdi, Guled Salah, Hussein Yusuf Ali, Kalinaki Lawrence Quintin, Mohamed Abdi Hassan, Salim Said, Amina Khan and Ed Laws.</narrative>
  </description>
